<!--/Post: 80-->
<!--Post: 82--><!--Time: 1085512812-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST82"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilahsue<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilahsue<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 25, 2004 - 12:20 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It&#39;s not on until tonight Tom but I&#39;m sure somebody will be posting details.  If not...I&#39;d be glad to.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
